14. Final Design Statement
The final CAS app should be a consent-led, offline-capable, multilingual Android fieldwork system that translates the full ICSSR instrument kit into a safe and auditable workflow. Its success will not be measured only by whether it collects data, but by whether it collects data ethically, protects the oldest old participants, preserves methodological quality, and produces anonymised evidence that can support legal and policy reform on age-inclusive smart city governance.

