Observation
Separate consent -> real destination confirmation -> start timer -> route/service/staff logs -> accessibility heuristic -> FI reflection


Doctrinal review
Create document review -> select source type -> add citation -> extract legal/policy content -> map to objective -> synthesis memo -> PI review


