DataUsage.md
CivicAge Survey (CAS) Data Usage, Anonymisation, Storage, Sharing, and QA Policy
Project: Smart Cities, Silent Citizens - ICSSR Major Research Project 2025-26
Purpose: Define how CAS data is collected, anonymised, stored, checked, exported, and shared without exposing participants or institutions.
1. Data Usage Idea
The data policy must make sure that the app collects rich field evidence without turning vulnerable participants into identifiable data points. The app therefore separates names from answers, uses participant codes for all research records, stores direct identifiers in a locked linkage file, deletes audio after transcription, anonymises institutions by default, and exports only QA-approved, anonymised data.
